  m_text: 'Instructions:

    1. Put the correct magical crystal into pot to get
    the potion (Red is related to strength, green is related to intelligence, and
    purple-yellow is related to eyesight.).


    2. Drink(Press Trigger) the potion
    to see invisible text on the other wall (You can only see these words from a
    certain angle). '
